    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Kaemi is a being capable of summoning a spirit and acquiring its abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All communication from Fjord Island got lost after an artic storm engulfed the island. The herald sent from the City of Pera did not come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pera: Episode 1 - Fjord Island, players join Gabriel Nightgale, a Kaemi dispatched from the City of Pera, to investigate the mystery surrounding Fjord Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Gabriel Nightgale, players will explore the island, collect clues and evidences, and overcome obstacles in order to solve the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pera: Episode 1 is a short story driven game set in an atmospheric island and focused on solving a mystery.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Kaemi is a being capable of summoning a spirit and acquiring its abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All communication from Fjord Island got lost after an artic storm engulfed the island. The herald sent from the City of Pera did not come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pera: Episode 1 - Fjord Island, players join Gabriel Nightgale, a Kaemi dispatched from the City of Pera, to investigate the mystery surrounding Fjord Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Gabriel Nightgale, players will explore the island, collect clues and evidences, and overcome obstacles in order to solve the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pera: Episode 1 is a short story driven game set in an atmospheric island and focused on solving a mystery.</p>",
    "short_description": "A story driven, open world, action adventure set in the northern and remote Fjord Island. Gabriel Nightgale, a Kaemi from the City of Pera, is dispatched to investigate and uncover the mystery surrounding the island.",
